---
---
<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
      
      <!-- Left: Real Photo of Jimaco Commercial Team (Exact match to screenshot) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative h-[360px] sm:h-[440px] bg-[#E8F0E6] overflow-hidden group">
        <img
          src="/images/fondo-cta-jimaco.jpg"
          alt="Equipo Comercial Asesores JIMACO"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-103 transition-transform duration-700"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Light Cream/Beige Text Box (#F6F4EF) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#F6F4EF] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0B1E02] leading-tight">
            ¿Buscas un <span class="text-[#7BBE6F] font-bold">aliado estratégico</span> de suministros para tu proyecto?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#4A5747] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Nuestro equipo comercial está listo para asesorarte y garantizarte la mejor solución para tu necesidad
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex justify-end">
          <a
            href="/contacto"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#0B1E02] hover:text-[#1C6521] font-display font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-wider group"
          >
            <span>Contáctanos ahora</span>
            <span class="text-jimaco-orange group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform text-lg">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
